// from cases/phases/record-a-lower-bound-a-coercion-constraint-and-an-equation.case
// A value passing into an unknown is a lower bound, recorded as a lower bound; into
// a type the text writes, a coercion constraint; an invariant place gives an equation.
// Each is recorded as the text gives it, before anything is solved.
// not asserted here: //@ order:
// not asserted here: assert record records `1u8 <= A`;
// not asserted here: assert record records `1u8 ~> W`;
// not asserted here: assert record records `A = B`;
w <- u8;
one_u8 <- u8;
a <- one_u8;
w <- one_u8;
a <- b;
b <- a;

assert accepted;
assert b: u8;
